§§ `s 51 — entry`

GIVEN hours     IS A NUMBER
      ends      IS A DATE
      objected  IS A BOOLEAN
      effected  IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH AN `Entry notice`
`an entry notice of` hours `hours, ending` ends `; objected` objected `; purpose effected` effected MEANS
    `Entry notice` WITH
        `states the wish to enter`        IS TRUE
        `specifies the purpose`           IS TRUE
        `specifies the right to object`   IS TRUE
        `objection period in hours`       IS hours
        `specifies how to object`         IS TRUE
        `date the objection period ends`  IS ends
        `objection made`                  IS objected
        `date the purpose was effected`   IS effected

-- (2)(c): "not less than 24 hours".
#ASSERT     `a notice in accordance with s 51(2)` (`an entry notice of` 24 `hours, ending` (YMD 2025 12 2) `; objected` FALSE `; purpose effected` NOTHING)
#ASSERT NOT `a notice in accordance with s 51(2)` (`an entry notice of` 23 `hours, ending` (YMD 2025 12 2) `; objected` FALSE `; purpose effected` NOTHING)
-- (1)(b) and (3): objection period ends 2 Dec 2025; the notice has effect
-- until 7 days after, 9 Dec, unless the purpose is effected first.
#ASSERT NOT `s 51(1) permits` `the ranger` `to enter, on` (`after a notice` (`an entry notice of` 24 `hours, ending` (YMD 2025 12 2) `; objected` FALSE `; purpose effected` NOTHING)) `, on` (YMD 2025 12 2)
#ASSERT     `s 51(1) permits` `the ranger` `to enter, on` (`after a notice` (`an entry notice of` 24 `hours, ending` (YMD 2025 12 2) `; objected` FALSE `; purpose effected` NOTHING)) `, on` (YMD 2025 12 3)
#ASSERT     `s 51(1) permits` `the ranger` `to enter, on` (`after a notice` (`an entry notice of` 24 `hours, ending` (YMD 2025 12 2) `; objected` FALSE `; purpose effected` NOTHING)) `, on` (YMD 2025 12 9)
#ASSERT NOT `s 51(1) permits` `the ranger` `to enter, on` (`after a notice` (`an entry notice of` 24 `hours, ending` (YMD 2025 12 2) `; objected` FALSE `; purpose effected` NOTHING)) `, on` (YMD 2025 12 10)
#ASSERT NOT `s 51(1) permits` `the ranger` `to enter, on` (`after a notice` (`an entry notice of` 24 `hours, ending` (YMD 2025 12 2) `; objected` FALSE `; purpose effected` (JUST (YMD 2025 12 5)))) `, on` (YMD 2025 12 6)
#ASSERT NOT `s 51(1) permits` `the ranger` `to enter, on` (`after a notice` (`an entry notice of` 24 `hours, ending` (YMD 2025 12 2) `; objected` TRUE  `; purpose effected` NOTHING)) `, on` (YMD 2025 12 3)
#ASSERT     `s 51(1) permits` `the ranger` `to enter, on` `with consent` `, on` (YMD 2025 12 3)
#ASSERT     `s 51(1) permits` `the ranger` `to enter, on` `under a warrant` `, on` (YMD 2025 12 3)
#ASSERT NOT `s 51(1) permits` `the ranger` `to enter, on` `on no footing` `, on` (YMD 2025 12 3)
#ASSERT NOT `s 51(1) permits` `a clerk`    `to enter, on` `with consent` `, on` (YMD 2025 12 3)

